# Bitstream & Implementation Outputs
# ==========================================
*.bit
*.bin
*.ltx
*.sysdef
*.hdf
*.dsa
*.xsa

# ==========================================
# IP Core Generated Files
# ==========================================
# Ignore generated output files for IP cores, but keep the core configuration (.xci)
*.ip_user_files/
*_stub.v
*_stub.vhdl
*_sim_netlist.v
*_sim_netlist.vhdl
*_ooc.xdc

